    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this superb one bedroom, one bathroom apartment to the market in the ever-popular development of Weavers Court, Clondalkin, Dublin 22. This bright, well located apartment is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers well-proportioned living accommodation comprising of an entrance hallway, open-plan lounge/diner, Kitchen area, double bedroom and bathroom. The property further benefits from 2 Juliette balconies, no onward chain and allocated parking. Weavers Court is ideally located close to a wealth of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, parks, and leisure facilities. The area is very well serviced by public transport with excellent bus routes nearby and easy access to the N7, M50, and The Red Cow Luas Stop, making travel to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas extremely convenient. Due to price, condition and opportunity, we see this property being extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest and book a viewing.\n\n\nKey Features\nBer C\nC. 37 Sqm\n2420 Management fees per annum\nNo onward chain\nAllocated parking\nClose to amenities\nEasy access to N7, M50 and Luas\nSought after development\nFantastic opportunity\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nD22 X883"
      },
